<description>&lt;p&gt;Criminal groups linked to drug trafficking are continuing to target civilians and public figures across Ecuador, with prison gangs operating as drug trafficking hubs and a man sentenced for fentanyl and heroin offenses. A journalist, Tomás Beltrán, was murdered outside his home, two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, and a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass. Fishermen who survived U.S. drone strikes at sea have filed lawsuits against the United States, alleging manifestly unlawful attacks. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOUlY2b3JyZlNXQkttOUNVVWpqNVpBMTZsSzFMLUVGaTZiMElsc2g3R0JybHp2T2xvSGgyQnhkYVRkTy1GUUZEUU9JRlpsZlAyQnJwZTVtdWd5MTJ5bFJCSTdjdFRxNVM1aFJKUjB5WHVabFBfT2FuX3lrY3psbk81TW1YNGhCYTBzRnY2SWFaLTNQdUtEUmdBS09ENGEyVmxaVjE2T0c0M0g0b1NLSU9sWEJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNc2hsR2xiSHdjSjJsX2kyOV83Q1dRNzUzVW1KLXJobHVHdmVaUy1SWDZqemZXRE5yNGctT1NZWk1LNHJyRnNMODVha0JUSGd6U1A4enZLNkVDbTJBNWdWRmgtc3ZwVEZLZXFRaFVUY2s3bzZ3QTVkSnIwR0h5cVBZNXBkb3NXdmZ1RUR3WVBFS0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;95.3 MNC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOb0l0dUIyOE1ReUtvT3U4d0JNMk9jUWl4QUNEMjNncEVMMHRqYVZHOUViR05KNEJjU0pjeWJLV3AzN1hqT0gwVlhybHUwcW9RMnNveFRNVUp3VERjR3VVLVdLdnI3SFZKdUgyUno0UE9rREFyTGdHVEF4cElfZVJfNE9UMGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;조선일보&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOblZpekFhcUVrOGd1aDVZRDZkaWdMNEVILWhPOWx2bTg2MmMyMzVCOEFYQWdkQXoyRlgyTkN1LWphWUtwV18yaEdvVkxuNDlpY2dwMlYzMWtXdUU5bG1BQUlsUnpkeTZJeVJSRnh5MkhuTGJiWERaZlB5Q29GREo2dWRfQ2lZUU5mNHc5M2trS083TkdGN2lxZkxqTTVwOU1ub3hnWnNkRG53T0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;Welcome to the United Nations&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot